  "bv2:106.2": "khaṇe tasmiṃ na vijjati ",
  "bv2:106.3": "tāni ajja padissanti ",
  "bv2:106.4": "dhuvaṃ buddho bhavissasi. ",
  "bv2:107.1": "[ime nimittā dissanti sambodhatthāya pāṇinaṃ] daḷhaṃ paggayha viriyaṃ ",
